      "title": "Don't forget to set appropriate denoise!",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "It's easy to forget to set `denoise` appropriately when you switch from working on empty latent and an existing image input. Even though this is not exclusive to our node suite, if you ever wonder why you get brownish-green output or a suspiciously irrelevant image, this might be the cause!"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "It's easy to forget to set `denoise` appropriately when you switch from working on empty latent and an existing image input. Even though this is not exclusive to our node suite, if you ever wonder why you get brownish-green output or a suspiciously irrelevant image, this might be the cause!"
      },
